:: MP Collection Resolve CrownGear Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
机括城的主泵房里，三枚齿轮终于套进王冠状的传动架。配重缓缓抬起，暗河的水位在刻度管里一格一格退下去。可主发条还在回弹，你必须在它咬死之前把锁销插进轴心。
<<set _ok to 0>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[托塞拉保管 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<stress -4>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">托塞拉保管 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-crowngear-step3">
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280 or ($science or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "拆解暗槽 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-crowngear-step3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 320 or ($science or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _ok to 1>>
	你顶住回弹的铜柄，把锁销一寸寸推到位。泵轴重新转动时，整座石廊都跟着轻轻一震。
	<<stress -4>>
<<set _reward to 800>>
<<if _ok is 1>><<set _reward to 2500>>
<<elseif $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_ratio"] or $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_path"]>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpDoneCrownGear to 1>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_crown_gear_complete")>>
<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<<willpower 4>><<control 12>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_crown_gear_payout")>>
你把泵房里拆下的一枚旧王冠齿徽收进衣袋，又从工具柜底层翻出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的维修备用金。
<<money _reward>><<stress -6>>
<<else>>
泵房已经恢复运转，工具柜里没有第二笔备用金。
<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[嵌回王冠齿轮 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<control 8>><<stress -2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锁销在最后一寸滑脱，回弹的铜柄扫过你的肋骨。水位退到一半又停住，你只能先松开手。
	<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve CrownGear Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拆解暗槽 (0:05)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
