<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-abysspage">
<<if ($history or 0) gte 280 or ($english or 0) gte 280>><<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link "问旧修院编号 (0:05)">><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-abysspage">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($english or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_abyss_page_order"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你按羊皮背后的针孔把三页排成回环，启句与应答终于接上。乔丹在旁轻轻呼出一口气。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<mphearticon>><<link [[询问旧修院编号 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage Step2]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">询问旧修院编号 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[拓下三页 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage Step2]]>><<stress -1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把应答页放反了。灯焰一歪，蜡油滴在边角，焦味立刻漫开。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>伸手把灯移远。
	<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请乔丹指认页的旧修院编号 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问旧修院编号 (0:05)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
