	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<link [[请悉尼抄页 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage Step3]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请悉尼抄页 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你辨认太久，铅笔在拓片边缘划出一道灰痕。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>图书馆助手<</if>>摇头，把抄本收回柜里。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回神殿 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
