	<<walkicon>><<link [[回沉船滩 (0:09)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step3]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[守到退潮 (0:12)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step3]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把潮汐时辰记错了半刻。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>没说什么，只把缆绳收回去，指了指坞门外已经漫上来的水线。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
