<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 320 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _ok to 1>>
	你顶住箱盖的回压，把最后一枚印面推到底。锁舌弹开，咸水顺着你的手腕流进袖口。
	<<stress -4>>
<<set _reward to 800>>
<<if _ok is 1>><<set _reward to 2500>>
<<elseif $mpClues["collect_smuggler_ring_tide"] or $mpClues["collect_smuggler_ring_shape"]>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<</if>>
