<<willpower 4>><<control 10>><<trauma -3>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_smuggler_ring_payout")>>
箱里没有整箱金币，只有几卷用蜡布包好的旧钞和一枚压舱用的银锭，折合约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
铁箱里只剩被海水泡烂的账页，没有新的进项。
<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[沉回潮线 (0:12)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<control 8>><<stress -2>><<pass 12>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	印面在最后一格卡住，箱盖回弹夹住你的虎口。你不得不先用撬棍别住缝隙，再重新对齐。
	<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">上前处置 (0:05)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
秘密温室的玻璃穹顶下，三株银丝花分装在编号不同的标本瓶里。花丝细得像头发，灯一照就泛冷光。你把瓶子并排举起，三束花丝在玻璃上叠出一段断续的银线——那不是花纹，是一条被拆成三截的路。路的尽头，应该就是花房后墙那道被封死的暗门。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower">
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280 or ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<walkicon>><<link "去深林石环 (0:09)">><<pass 9>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_bride_flower_pollen"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你屏住呼吸换掉瓶里的旧水，没让花粉扬起来。银线在灯下稳定下来，指向温室后墙。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往深林石环 (0:09)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step2]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<link [[问花的来历 (0:12)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step2]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>><<stress -1>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问花的来历 (0:12)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	瓶塞一松，细白的花粉扑上你的脸。温室忽然安静得过分，你扶着花架等眼前的颜色慢慢退回去。
	<<stress 6>><<trauma 2>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去深林石环 (0:09)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
深林石环的苔面还留着夜露。你把三株银丝花按编号摆在石缝里，月光穿过花丝，在中央石板上投下三圈互相错开的银线。
石环边缘刻着旧德鲁伊的月相记号。你得把花丝投下的影子对回记号，才能看出它们真正指向哪里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower-step2">
<<if ($history or 0) gte 280 or ($science or 0) gte 280>><<walkicon>><<link "返回温室花园 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower-step2">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 300 or ($science or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_bride_flower_moon"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你转动标本瓶，让三圈银线在石板上合成一条完整的弧。弧的尽头，苔层下面露出一道细缝。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回温室花园 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[刮开苔层 (0:12)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step3]]>><<stress -1>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你对了很久，影子始终差着一指。夜风把花瓣吹得发颤，你只好用石头压住瓶口，先记下大致方位。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回温室花园 (0:08)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "garden">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Park")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Park">>
<</if>>
温室后墙的暗门后是一间废弃的蒸馏花房。铜釜、冷凝管和一只缺角的白瓷盘都还在。你把三株标本拆开，银丝花在盘里褪成半透明的薄片。
提纯要控火。火大一分，银丝就焦；火小一分，花液不肯离析。窗外传来巡夜人的脚步声。
<<set _ok to 0>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<link [[交银花簪 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>><<stress -4>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">交银花簪 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower-step3">
<<if ($science or 0) gte 280 or ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "稳住心神 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-brideflower-step3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 320 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _ok to 1>>
	你把火压到只剩一圈蓝边，花液一滴一滴落进瓷盘。银丝在盘底留下完整的花形。
	<<stress -4>>
<<set _reward to 800>>
<<if _ok is 1>><<set _reward to 2500>>
<<elseif $mpClues["collect_bride_flower_moon"] or $mpClues["collect_bride_flower_pollen"]>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpDoneBrideFlower to 1>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_bride_flower_complete")>>
<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<<willpower 4>><<control 10>><<trauma -5>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_bride_flower_payout")>>
瓷盘底层粘着一只旧银花簪，簪头刻着温室的标记。你把它和约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的花房备用金一起收好。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
花房里只剩冷却的铜釜，没有第二份备用金。
<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[压入标本册 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<control 8>><<trauma -2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火苗窜高，银丝卷成焦黑的一团。冷凝管里只积了半盏浑浊的液体，你得重新挑花。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve BrideFlower Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">稳住心神 (0:05)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Collection Resolve VelvetCrest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">>
<</if>>
天鹅绒暗层后廊的试衣间里，三枚暗金徽章摊在丝绒托盘上。边齿能互相咬合，叠在一起时，背面浮出一朵完整的黑鸢尾。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>>布莱尔<<else>>俱乐部东家<</if>>说，这是三年舞会的贵宾徽章，凑齐的人能进画库；画库里挂着什么，得自己去看。
