<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 280 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<walkicon>><<link "找刻印师 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-velvetcrest">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 300 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_velvet_crest_pattern"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你顺着布莱尔的话尾接下去，让她把托盘往你这边推了半寸。黑鸢尾的轮廓在灯下完全合拢。
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往康努斯街 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve VelvetCrest Step2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<link [[听完提醒 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve VelvetCrest Step2]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>><<npcincr Briar love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">听完提醒 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	你的目光在徽章上停得太久。门外传来高跟鞋声，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>>布莱尔<<else>>俱乐部东家<</if>>随手盖上丝绒布，朝你摇了摇头。
	<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve VelvetCrest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找刻印师 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Collection Resolve VelvetCrest Step2 [nobr]
