<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_velvet_crest_complete")>>
<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<<willpower 4>><<control 12>><<trauma -3>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_velvet_crest_payout")>>
小厅的矮柜里放着一只鎏金画框扣和几卷没用完的贵宾券，折合约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
矮柜已经空了，镜墙后面只剩蒙布和灰尘。
