<<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_manifest"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你从车次、重量和保费里推出一个固定差额。那笔钱没有进孤儿院，而是被拆成三份继续往下一站走。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[回旧储物室 (0:09)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step2]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[拓下压印纸 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step2]]>><<set $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_copy"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><<stress -1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你把两组数字看串了行。站台尽头的信号灯忽然转红，老工人把你往货箱后面一按，等巡道车过去才松手。
	<<pain 2>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回旧储物室 (0:09)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
孤儿院旧储物室的门轴响了一声。你把三把密匙放在那摞发霉的旧账册上，账册封皮内侧的编号与匙柄一一对应。
最上面一本只写到建院第三年，后面几页被整齐裁掉。裁口很平，不是孩子能弄出来的。
<<if $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_copy"]>><span class="teal">对照先前抄下的货单编号，你立刻从霉味扑鼻的旧账堆里抽出了对应的册子。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-ledgerkey-step2">
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>><<keepsakeicon>><<link "查看铅封铁匣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-ledgerkey-step2">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['collect_ledger_key_copy'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_entries"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span>
	你从残存的抬头和印章里对出经手人的姓氏。最后一页的边角还留着半个货运站的收货戳。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[细看铅封铁匣 (0:07)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step3]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<link [[问建院账目 (0:06)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step3]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问建院账目 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	霉味呛得你眼睛发酸。你翻了几页，字母在昏暗里糊成一片，只记得那几个反复出现的编号。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">查看铅封铁匣 (0:07)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
铅封铁匣压在储物室最底层，三重锁孔排成一行。你把三把密匙同时插进去，锁芯里传来三种不同的阻力。最左边那把要先退半格，中间那把得顶着簧片转。
匣盖弹开一条缝，里面不是金币，是一册用油布包好的建院总账和几叠旧存单。
<<set _ok to 0>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<link [[交密匙拓本 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>><<stress -4>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">交密匙拓本 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-collection-resolve-ledgerkey-step3">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280 or ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "上前应对 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-collection-resolve-ledgerkey-step3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _ok to 1>>
	你把三把钥匙按顺序压到底，锁芯同时松开。油布包滑出来时，匣底只剩一层薄薄的铜绿。
	<<stress -4>>
<<set _reward to 800>>
<<if _ok is 1>><<set _reward to 2500>>
<<elseif $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_entries"] or $mpClues["collect_ledger_key_manifest"]>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpDoneLedgerKey to 1>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_ledger_key_complete")>>
<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<<willpower 4>><<control 10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_ledger_key_payout")>>
存单里有一张还没兑付的旧票，连同匣底的零散银币约合 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。你把总账留在原处，只带走能证明来路的部分。
<<money _reward>><<stress -5>>
<<else>>
铁匣已经空了，总账还压在油布上。
<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<keepsakeicon>><<link [[封回铁匣 (0:08)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<control 8>><<trauma -2>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	中间那把钥匙卡在簧片里。你抽出时带出一小截断齿，只能先用发卡别住锁芯，再从侧面撬开。
	<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Collection Resolve LedgerKey Step3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">上前应对 (0:05)（属性不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
